{"2131150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terranny", "steam_appid": 2131150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[code]This game is not for everyone. Please try the demo before buying, your progress will carry over.[/code]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We have gone through hell and back to acquire the SWARM software used by Terranos Engineering. Help us figure out its nefarious purposes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Know your enemy, explore features of the software that are listed below:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A.cquire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn</i> parts, decals, badges, and titles by completing missions and competing in PvP seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.uild</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/c90c4fc87ce33519d5905ff9b3a66c2c.poster.avif?t=1786316309\" width=760 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/c90c4fc87ce33519d5905ff9b3a66c2c.webm?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/c90c4fc87ce33519d5905ff9b3a66c2c.mp4?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Design</i> a custom drone from a variety of parts. Adjust attachment locations and angles to produce ultimate killing machines. Change part colors and add decals for a bit of personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C.ode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/ddea6d23da3a9a00124292411e4b7943.poster.avif?t=1786316309\" width=760 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/ddea6d23da3a9a00124292411e4b7943.webm?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/ddea6d23da3a9a00124292411e4b7943.mp4?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Program</i> each part of your drone with a custom visual programming interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D.eploy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/b7cdee7f5b49e752db64520b171e0c19.poster.avif?t=1786316309\" width=760 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/b7cdee7f5b49e752db64520b171e0c19.webm?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/b7cdee7f5b49e752db64520b171e0c19.mp4?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Send your drones on various <i>missions</i> to earn rewards, with different goals in each level. Try to beat your fastest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E.valuate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submit and play custom missions crafted by fellow engineers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F.launt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/8baac53f33bf6029515f55c8c8804819.poster.avif?t=1786316309\" width=760 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/8baac53f33bf6029515f55c8c8804819.webm?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/8baac53f33bf6029515f55c8c8804819.mp4?t=1786316309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Show off your creations against other engineers in <i>asynchronous PvP</i> battles. Your opponents do not have to be online to be challenged. Participate in different modes, such as 1v1 or a 6 drone free-for-all battle. Earn rating to climb the seasonal leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G.auge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in <i>tournaments</i>  to see if your team can come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>H.ave</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fun</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[code]This game is not for everyone. Please try the demo before buying, your progress will carry over.[/code]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We have gone through hell and back to acquire the SWARM software used by Terranos Engineering. Help us figure out its nefarious purposes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Know your enemy, explore features of the software that are listed below:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A.cquire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn</i> parts, decals, badges, and titles by completing missions and competing in PvP seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.uild</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131150/extras/c90c4fc87ce33519d5905ff9b3